\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. SPIRIT blest, who art adored
\par With the Father and the Word
\par One eternal God and Lord:
\par Hear us, Holy Spirit.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Holy Spirit, heavenly Dove.
\par Dew descending from above,
\par Breath of life and fire of love:
\par Hear us, Holy Spirit,
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Spirit, guiding us aright,
\par Spirit, making darkness light,
\par Spirit of resistless might :
\par Hear us, Holy Spirit.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Thou whom Jesus from His throne
\par Gave to cheer and help His own,
\par That they might not be alone:
\par Hear us, Holy Spirit.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. All our evil passions kill; 
\par Bend aright our stubborn will;
\par Through we grieve Thee, patient still:
\par Hear us, Holy Spirit.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. Come, to raise us when we fall;
\par And, when snares our souls enthral,
\par Lead us back with gentle call:
\par Hear us, Holy Spirit.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 7\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 7. Come, to strengthen all the weak;
\par Give Thy courage to the meek;
\par Teach our faltering tongues to speak:
\par Hear us, Holy Spirit
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 8\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 8. Come, to aid the souls who yearn
\par More of truth divine to learn,
\par And with deeper love to burn:
\par Hear us, Holy Spirit.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 9\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 9. Keep us in the narrow way;
\par Warn us when we go astray;
\par Plead within us when we pray:
\par Hear us, Holy Spirit.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 10\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 10. Holy, loving, as Thou art,
\par All Thy sevenfold gifts impart;
\par Nevermore from us depart:
\par Hear us, Holy Spirit.\tab\tab 
\par                      Amen.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f1\fs16 
\par \f2 
\par }

